        "pwm_output",
        "button"
      ],
      "notes": "Button B — onboard pushbutton, active-high (reads HIGH when pressed). Same confirmation and reasoning as GPIO10/Button A above (official Getting Started guide's \"Button B (GPIO 11)\" caption, Arduino library source, MicroPython example)."
