        "led_neopixel"
      ],
      "notes": "NeoPixel Matrix data line — onboard 5x5 (25-pixel) WS2812 addressable RGB matrix display, output-only, row-major wired starting at this pin. Confirmed via the official Getting Started guide's hardware-overview page (\"Neopixel Matrix (GPIO 17)\") and section 1.1's pixel-numbering diagram (\"Melopero Cookie RP2040 is equipped with a 5x5 neopixels matrix display, which can be accessed through pin GPIO17\"). digital_input/pwm_output omitted, matching this repo's established NeoPixel-tagging vocabulary (vccgnd_yd_rp2040 GPIO23, adafruit_feather_scorpio GPIO4, waveshare_rp2040_zero GPIO16 precedents) — pwm_output is not meaningful for a bit-serial WS2812 data line."
    },
